  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Global Partnership for Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support the Government of Lao PDR in improving pre-primary and primary education quality.This will be done by: (i) providing additional funding at school, district and provincial levels, as well as strengthening overall capacity to manage these resources to achieve minimum education quality standards and (ii) enhancing the teaching and learning environment in schools through improved teaching practices, instructional resources and analytical products to support early grade literacy.</narrative>
  </description>
